Error [jet.EnumValuesUnavailable]: `Shape.Circle` carries a payload, so `Shape` has no list of case values
  --> Tests/UI/e0949_enum_values_payload.jet:13:27
    |
 13 |     print(Shape.reflect().values.len())
    |                           ^^^^^^
 Why: `.values` lists every case once as a value, and a case with a payload is no value until its data is given
 Fix: Remove the payload from `Circle`, or list the values you need yourself
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0949

Error [jet.EnumValuesUnavailable]: `Point` is not an enum, so it has no case values
  --> Tests/UI/e0949_enum_values_payload.jet:14:27
    |
 14 |     print(Point.reflect().values.len())
    |                           ^^^^^^
 Why: `.values` lists the cases of an enum that carry no payload; any other type has no fixed set of values to list
 Fix: Read `.values` on an enum whose cases carry no payload, or list the values you need yourself
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0949

